          "mechanism": "Type 1 diabetes could function as a confounder if both diabetes diagnosis and hypertension diagnosis drive insurance seeking; could be a mediator if insurance improves diabetes management which affects hypertension control; or could be on a reverse pathway if hypertension affects diabetes outcomes.",
