          "mechanism": "Chronic kidney disease has multiple potential roles: it can be a cause of secondary hypertension (mediator on a causal pathway from insurance to hypertension via improved kidney health management); a consequence of long-standing hypertension-related renal damage (descendant of hypertension diagnosis); or an independent confounder.",
